摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH plugin switchboard: Settings tab with descriptions, fuzzy search, and runtime start/stop","id":"gh:1335204415","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-toggle","slug":"DamonKoy/dsh-plugin-toggle","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH plugin switchboard: Settings tab with descriptions, fuzzy search, and runtime start/stop"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-toggle"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness (DSH) **plugin switchboard** for the web GUI."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Open **Settings → Plugins → Plugin Switch**. Every loaded plugin is a card with:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- a short description (from that package's `package.json` `description`)\n- enabled / disabled + fibe"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"r phase (running / pending / failed / …)\n- **Start / Stop** (runtime only — does **not** rewrite `co"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"rdis.yml`)\n- fuzzy search (name / module / id / description; subsequence match)"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Core / surface plugins (`webserver`, `connection`, `session`, `agent`, …) are marked **Core** and ca"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"nnot be stopped from this UI, so the page cannot take itself down."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then open **Settings → Plugins → Plugin Switch**."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Or add the repo as a profile dependency and include the bundle:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then `pnpm install` in the profile directory and restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Feature | Notes |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Plugin cards | Title, entry id, description, enabled tag, phase |\n| Categories | Grouped sections "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"(core / UI / theme / tools / fun / other), collapsible |\n| Sorting | Within a group: togglable plugi"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ns first, then by status (running first), then name |\n| Fuzzy search | Tokens match as substring or "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"subsequence across fields incl. category |\n| Start / Stop | `entry.update({ disabled })` — runtime o"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"nly, no `tree.write()` |\n| Core guard | Surface/runtime entries cannot be stopped (id- and module-na"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"me-based); others need a two-step confirm |\n| Usage history | Every toggle is persisted to `~/.dsh/d"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"sh-plugin-toggle.jsonl` (last 1000), shown in a collapsible “使用记录” section |\n| Persistence | Install"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"ed as a composition plugin — survives `dsh web` restarts |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## HTTP API (same origin)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Method | Path | Role |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `GET` | `/plugin-toggle/list` | `{ entries: [...] }` |\n| `GET` | `/plugin-toggle/logs` | `{ record"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"s: [...] }` (recent usage history, newest first) |\n| `POST` | `/plugin-toggle/set` | `{ entryId, ena"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"bled }` → `{ ok, entry? \\| message? }` |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"`POST` is same-origin only."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The client `exports.inject` is the **service** name `slots` (not a package name). Using package name"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"s here parks the client fiber forever."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
